---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Resource Repository" 
  description="Curated primary research from our core influencers and partners in sentience, consciousness, and AI governance."
>
  <article class="py-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Research Ecosystem</h1>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-xl border border-csr-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Michael Levin (NCM/BBR Lab)</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-csr-gray-600 mb-4">Pioneering morphological intelligence and bio-electric field modeling.</p>
        <a href="https://drmichaellevin.org/" target="_blank" class="text-csr-primary text-sm font-bold hover:underline">Visit Lab &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-xl border border-csr-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Lee Cronin (Cronin Lab)</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-csr-gray-600 mb-4">Founder of Assembly Theory and the physics of selection.</p>
        <a href="https://www.croninlab.com/" target="_blank" class="text-csr-primary text-sm font-bold hover:underline">Visit Lab &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-xl border border-csr-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Andrés Gómez Emilsson (QRI)</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-csr-gray-600 mb-4">Research on the Symmetry Theory of Valence and qualia geometry.</p>
        <a href="https://qri.org/" target="_blank" class="text-csr-primary text-sm font-bold hover:underline">Visit Qualia Institute &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-xl border border-csr-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Robin Carhart-Harris</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-csr-gray-600 mb-4">Pioneer of the Entropic Brain hypothesis and psychedelic neuroimaging.</p>
        <a href="https://www.imperial.ac.uk/psychedelic-studies-collaborative/" target="_blank" class="text-csr-primary text-sm font-bold hover:underline">Explore Research &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
